---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const milestones = [
  {year:'1935',title:'A published cortical-recording milestone',text:'Foerster and Altenburger published "Elektrobiologische Vorgänge an der menschlichen Hirnrinde" in February 1935. The accessible publisher page establishes the title, authors and date, not the electrode geometry. This is a dated publication milestone, not a claim to the first-ever cortical recording.',url:'https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/BF01732786',label:'Original publication record'},
  {year:'2011',title:'Active switching cuts the wire count',text:'Viventi and colleagues described a flexible 360-channel array with 300 × 300 µm electrodes at 500 µm spacing, using 720 silicon nanomembrane transistors. The 25 µm array could be folded around a roughly 700 µm silicone insert. The paper reports visual-cortex recordings in ten cats, including placement in the interhemispheric fissure.',url:'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3235709/',label:'Primary manuscript'},
  {year:'2014',title:'196 sites for auditory-cortex mapping',text:'The active micro-ECoG array used 196 sites in a 14 × 14 matrix, 200 × 200 µm contacts and 250 µm center pitch. It needed 29 interface wires. Acute recordings in three rats mapped auditory responses; this was not a chronic clinical result.',url:'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4137255/',label:'Primary manuscript',device:'/devices/65-active-microecog-auditory-cortex-array/'},
  {year:'2015',title:'Neuron-sized surface contacts',text:'NeuroGrid used 10 × 10 µm sites with 30 µm inter-electrode spacing on a 4 µm film. The paper describes surface recordings of putative single neurons in rats and intraoperative human recordings. Chronic human implantation was not demonstrated.',url:'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4308485/',label:'Primary manuscript',device:'/devices/24-neurogrid-pedot-pss-surface-array/'},
  {year:'2021',title:'Implanted surface recording for attempted speech',text:'The speech neuroprosthesis study used a customized PMT array and Blackrock percutaneous connector: 128 electrodes in a 16 × 8 lattice, 4 mm center pitch, a 6.7 × 3.5 cm footprint and 0.51 mm thickness. The participant attempted words from a 50-word vocabulary; the system decoded words and sentences during research sessions, not independent daily use.',url:'https://www.nejm.org/doi/full/10.1056/NEJMoa2027540',label:'Primary paper',device:'/devices/63-pmt-high-density-ecog-array-percutaneous-connector/'},
];
---
<Layout pageTitle="ECoG history" subtitle="Selected surface-recording milestones, with hardware and study results kept separate." description="A source-linked timeline of cortical surface recording, active arrays, NeuroGrid and speech neuroprostheses.">
  <section class="intro"><p>ECoG records electrical activity from the cortical surface. This timeline is a selection, not a complete history. It separates published hardware dimensions from what a study showed. An old paper does not establish that a technology failed or stopped developing.</p><p><a href="/devices/">Device catalog</a> · <a href="/applications/">Applications</a></p></section>
  <div class="timeline">{milestones.map(m => <section class="milestone"><span class="year">{m.year}</span><div><h2>{m.title}</h2><p>{m.text}</p><p class="links"><a href={m.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{m.label} ↗</a>{m.device && <> · <a href={m.device}>Hardware entry →</a></>}</p></div></section>)}</div>
  <section class="intro"><h2>What remains outside this timeline</h2><p>Earlier animal recording work, the full clinical epilepsy-surgery history, commercial grid development and newer arrays need their own source checks. The 1935 record is included without invented specs. No milestone here is labeled a dead end without evidence of that outcome.</p></section>
</Layout>
<style>
  .intro{max-width:800px;line-height:1.7}.intro p{opacity:.8}.intro h2{font-size:var(--title-section);font-weight:400}
  .timeline{display:grid;gap:16px;margin:28px 0}.milestone{display:grid;grid-template-columns:90px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;background:var(--panel)}
  .year{font-size:28px;opacity:.65}.milestone h2{font-size:var(--title-card);font-weight:400;margin:0;line-height:1.15}.milestone p{line-height:1.7;margin:12px 0 0}.links{font-size:17px}.milestone a{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  @media(max-width:600px){.milestone{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px;padding:18px}.year{font-size:22px}}
</style>
